### 15. Lambda Reserved Concurrency — Potential Self-DoS

```yaml
ReservedConcurrentExecutions: 200
```

If your account Lambda concurrency limit is the default 1000, reserving 200 for this function is fine. **However**, the API Gateway throttle is set to:

```yaml
ThrottlingRateLimit: 100
ThrottlingBurstLimit: 500
```

500 burst with only 200 reserved Lambda concurrency means **300 requests will be throttled at Lambda** even though API Gateway allowed them through. Those requests will return 429 from Lambda perspective but API Gateway will report them as 500. Set these consistently:

```yaml
# Recommended aligned values:
ThrottlingRateLimit: 50
ThrottlingBurstLimit: 200
ReservedConcurrentExecutions: 200
```

