    - AllowedMethods:
        - GET  # Only GET now, was GET/POST/PUT in live template
```

The live template allowed `GET, POST, PUT`. The new template only allows `GET`. If any frontend JavaScript is doing `PUT` or `POST` directly to S3 (pre-signed URL uploads for video content), this will break with CORS errors. **Verify your upload flow** — if using pre-signed URLs from Lambda, PUT must be in this list.

