---

**What this means:**

```
The live StudentTable already has the EmailIndex GSI
on it from a previous partial update attempt.

When we tried to add it again in v4.2.5
DynamoDB said — that index already exists
and rejected the update.

CloudFormation cannot know the index is already
there because the table is in a drifted state.
```

